<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$0.50 higher. Demand moderate to light. Top $56.00 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 54.00-55.50, few 56.00.</p>
<p>Sows: Not established early</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.  42.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs.  46.00-49.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  50.00-54.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  53.00-55.00</p>
</text>
